  {
   "k": "sxwwlk",
   "en": "As opposed to a regular focus which provides one-time effects, the effects of a continuous focus benefit the nation whilst the chosen focus remains active. An active focus requires a maintenance cost of ⟦0⟧ Political power per day. The focus can, however, be deactivated or switched with another at any time for no additional cost.",
